    {
      "poem": "P03_LiBai_Dream",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "我欲因之梦吴越 / 一夜飞度镜湖月",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "e1bdf66182e7b441ed20a3826cc8f551f42765c9a49f647626ff4e93a0d25654"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P03_LiBai_Dream",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "我欲因之夢吳越 / 一夜飛度鏡湖月",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "49a37c3ca9289ec4de1fee3ca7ea174112ff08764178b5f0ac371d248d840f6d"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P03_LiBai_Dream",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "我之に因りて / 呉越を夢みんと欲し / 一夜飛んで度る / 鏡湖の月",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "a9abc0a93da45ac485e2713e48f3c1afad659c749348e2afe77ee73ed3102408"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P03_LiBai_Dream",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "I would dream my way / to Wu and Yue, / and in one night fly across / the moon on Mirror Lake",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "08230756fd587a6c1f16d23a0547299c01af9c6c",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "d94304d772937af2ff2c88ed3e2ffcf045325dc14bd30950914176b7e421a3f9"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P03_LiBai_Dream",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "I would dream my way / to Wu and Yue, / and in one night fly across / the moon on Mirror Lake",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "08230756fd587a6c1f16d23a0547299c01af9c6c",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "d94304d772937af2ff2c88ed3e2ffcf045325dc14bd30950914176b7e421a3f9"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04a_Rilke",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "因为美无非是 / 恐怖的开端",
      "source": "Rainer Maria Rilke, Duineser Elegien I (1923)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "74643ed2d40f409cd8b857181cf8cd7eb057d5dfc8e0c02f4f054333fdc66928"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04a_Rilke",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "因為美無非是 / 恐怖的開端",
      "source": "Rainer Maria Rilke, Duineser Elegien I (1923)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "be3da7de3b258f88840e967df29453fd095e88daa8a91fc6ed8073d145be15e4"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04a_Rilke",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "美とは、 / 恐ろしいものの / 始まりにほかならない",
      "source": "Rainer Maria Rilke, Duineser Elegien I (1923)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "5c44a9be80a1a9837ac36c6498c636ca294cc6969518c3aef18e4088b865066f"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04a_Rilke",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "For beauty is nothing but / the beginning of terror",
      "source": "Rainer Maria Rilke, Duineser Elegien I (1923)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "e1842af849df627ba2cc27a1c23bc98503c6eaf254f41400df36db1e23057a69"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04a_Rilke",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "de",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "Denn das Schöne ist nichts / als des Schrecklichen Anfang",
      "source": "Rainer Maria Rilke, Duineser Elegien I (1923)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "6dcb2fc55dfc497c52f47f561a4ea4c08d6faae9725ce244b1548126229e5e4e"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04b_Urlicht",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "啊，不！ / 我不肯被拒之门外！",
      "source": "Des Knaben Wunderhorn, „Urlicht“ (Mahler, Sym. 2, IV)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "91402fdcf6763d5ffce5d37c8ba7dd0f927697fd0ac9362fa871b9e3cf7c7c2c"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04b_Urlicht",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "啊，不！ / 我不肯被拒之門外！",
      "source": "Des Knaben Wunderhorn, „Urlicht“ (Mahler, Sym. 2, IV)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "cf5e72cd87446f6d4d3f881e37ba6fcda18d41efc337d082341bd55d5d6ea8ca"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04b_Urlicht",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "いいえ！ / わたしは引き下がらなかった！",
      "source": "Des Knaben Wunderhorn, „Urlicht“ (Mahler, Sym. 2, IV)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "b8d8cccb0137cc542a34eb0b31f6e97071ccd39cb1641649e48a3509cdb3fdcd"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04b_Urlicht",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "Ah no! / I would not be turned away!",
      "source": "Des Knaben Wunderhorn, „Urlicht“ (Mahler, Sym. 2, IV)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "182fd46640f56c30dcff981bc0b79da9e21fb15f9d71324f3424f6d123238c83"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P04b_Urlicht",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "de",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "Ach nein! / Ich ließ mich nicht abweisen!",
      "source": "Des Knaben Wunderhorn, „Urlicht“ (Mahler, Sym. 2, IV)",
      "original_language": "de",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "25274b8261f6cedd2e47a7c6f091204c1586d1195bf3672caa182059af1f4a49"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P06_Dream_Dawn",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "我从天空坠入深海",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "b67957b881cf7b38b9539d9d2b80a0e7140dd968b4eb40583a5bb70ae152c9aa"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P06_Dream_Dawn",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "我從天空墜入深海",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "c6e7170bacd5127573bb8dad2bdebf8380e50614d889fa50f29bbc840ad80a04"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P06_Dream_Dawn",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "わたしは空から / 深い海へ墜ちた",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "3c4f08c34cb3b67fa58d0b5c9792be2948fd83c2264a20481c49d18a91708c3d"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P06_Dream_Dawn",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "I fell from the sky / into the deep sea",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "b0fb6e1c932fda38669c6d06d4f03c272a2650e2805be7ec34875c8cdacc007b"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P06_Dream_Dawn",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "I fell from the sky / into the deep sea",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
