    },
    {
      "poem": "P07_HeBo",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "鱼鳞屋兮龙堂 / 紫贝阙兮朱宫 / 灵何为兮水中",
      "source": "屈原《九歌·河伯》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "a4143595931162d57f4d2c8e6aa2a9b30966d9910a2304c6803ee9f9c08a06b1"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P07_HeBo",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "魚鱗屋兮龍堂 / 紫貝闕兮朱宮 / 靈何為兮水中",
      "source": "屈原《九歌·河伯》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "ca70729957b909a6fb43a1648bb1649f68b4a439dc53144ea459c0148f14f21c"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P07_HeBo",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "魚鱗の屋、龍の堂 / 紫貝の闕、朱の宮 / 霊何為れぞ / 水中にある",
      "source": "屈原《九歌·河伯》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "30d1ccb3777e3ef8af7aefc98a39c72ecf1297a53a0f6ef21a9241a90f1ba40a"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P07_HeBo",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "Houses of fish-scale, / halls of dragons, / purple-shell gates, / a vermilion palace — / O spirit, why do you / dwell in the water?",
      "source": "屈原《九歌·河伯》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "089a9990a4f81b3533b4ac695242e4e01675867b7738cc8a479fe01d7a3ae08c"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P07_HeBo",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "Houses of fish-scale, / halls of dragons, / purple-shell gates, / a vermilion palace — / O spirit, why do you / dwell in the water?",
      "source": "屈原《九歌·河伯》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "089a9990a4f81b3533b4ac695242e4e01675867b7738cc8a479fe01d7a3ae08c"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08a_Dream_Dusk",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "自深海坠入另一片天空",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "20e96def1f8c5fcbc4c887ab99ba1a1fdef91e2ba9eb05ee14c62888c155cb8a"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08a_Dream_Dusk",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "自深海墜入另一片天空",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "e9a6208858e0eac7d6178b210ee893906ea0976d71c32a7a2caf87f6fff9ba24"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08a_Dream_Dusk",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "深い海から / もうひとつの空へ / 墜ちた",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "88b880e8b4e4155a8069ead727f858d170ca9c68c4f3e476b58eb36235c40f31"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08a_Dream_Dusk",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "From the deep sea I fell / into another sky",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "4d54d8b9ad5c06a72dc449662a741e6fc23ec7acaec8df4b2f842720fe6e76e7"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08a_Dream_Dusk",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "From the deep sea I fell / into another sky",
      "source": "用户梦中得句",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "4d54d8b9ad5c06a72dc449662a741e6fc23ec7acaec8df4b2f842720fe6e76e7"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08b_Zhuangzi_Xiaoyao",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "天之苍苍，其正色邪？",
      "source": "庄子《逍遥游》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "41e11e3dbeb44b7ddf9bfae1ca1d3dbec7a4a7f9882d613f85adad33ede430c1"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08b_Zhuangzi_Xiaoyao",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 1,
      "text": "天之苍苍，其正色邪？",
      "source": "庄子《逍遥游》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "41e11e3dbeb44b7ddf9bfae1ca1d3dbec7a4a7f9882d613f85adad33ede430c1"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08b_Zhuangzi_Xiaoyao",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 2,
      "text": "其视下也，亦若是则已矣",
      "source": "庄子《逍遥游》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "b620c5b1bb83b63ba60552b8a3b7c27588abdd64f7bc4f72ffbfac301fa73f0a"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08b_Zhuangzi_Xiaoyao",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 3,
      "text": "其视下也，亦若是则已矣",
      "source": "庄子《逍遥游》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "b620c5b1bb83b63ba60552b8a3b7c27588abdd64f7bc4f72ffbfac301fa73f0a"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08b_Zhuangzi_Xiaoyao",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "天之蒼蒼，其正色邪？",
      "source": "庄子《逍遥游》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
