    {
      "poem": "P08b_Zhuangzi_Xiaoyao",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 1,
      "text": "天之蒼蒼，其正色邪？",
      "source": "庄子《逍遥游》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "10880b5792901d42100b384959f849973df46d1b1ed62681a5d447897bb44456"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P08b_Zhuangzi_Xiaoyao",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 2,
      "text": "其視下也，亦若是則已矣",
      "source": "庄子《逍遥游》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "ccdb9292d6c90e11fe9c6adf1506a826f4b407b64f1a4c1995aca39192c3ab2c"
    },
    {
