    {
      "poem": "P09_Tianwen",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "遂古之初，谁传道之？ / 上下未形，何由考之？",
      "source": "屈原《天问》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "14e2f53875991adb6173731039e02b65a5a10a4007fd672bf7f3b41f1347b877"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P09_Tianwen",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "遂古之初，谁传道之？ / 上下未形，何由考之？",
      "source": "屈原《天问》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "14e2f53875991adb6173731039e02b65a5a10a4007fd672bf7f3b41f1347b877"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P09_Tianwen",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "遂古之初，谁传道之？ / 上下未形，何由考之？",
      "source": "屈原《天问》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "14e2f53875991adb6173731039e02b65a5a10a4007fd672bf7f3b41f1347b877"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P09_Tianwen",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 1,
      "text": "遂古の初め、誰か之を伝へ道ふ / 上下未だ形あらず / 何に由りて之を考ふる",
      "source": "屈原《天问》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "fd87ec5ce4710eba3af2d7bdf2324350155d2d7d272fd431ac178f828637a60c"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P09_Tianwen",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "遂古之初，谁传道之？ / 上下未形，何由考之？",
      "source": "屈原《天问》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "14e2f53875991adb6173731039e02b65a5a10a4007fd672bf7f3b41f1347b877"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P09_Tianwen",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 1,
      "text": "At the far beginning of things, / who was there to tell of it? / When above and below had no form, / how could it be known?",
      "source": "屈原《天问》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "e61af6c34fd5e7c5285ce25ec30b292d985ec76d6d54da94137fd26a80507dcf"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P09_Tianwen",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "遂古之初，谁传道之？ / 上下未形，何由考之？",
      "source": "屈原《天问》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "14e2f53875991adb6173731039e02b65a5a10a4007fd672bf7f3b41f1347b877"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P09_Tianwen",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 1,
      "text": "At the far beginning of things, / who was there to tell of it? / When above and below had no form, / how could it be known?",
      "source": "屈原《天问》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
