    },
    {
      "poem": "P11_Zhuangzi_Butterfly",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "不知周之梦为胡蝶与 / 胡蝶之梦为周与",
      "source": "庄子《齐物论》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "e36324c5812bd1b49c3dc92a5bd7c05ac3463e307cb4be8a6383ad4c1da55513"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P11_Zhuangzi_Butterfly",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "不知周之夢為胡蝶與 / 胡蝶之夢為周與",
      "source": "庄子《齐物论》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "b2b827b1c04e814fd9a7659b8b8009a245741364ff7ed4e8a0dcbf072c1b2ae9"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P11_Zhuangzi_Butterfly",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "知らず / 周の夢に胡蝶と為れるか / 胡蝶の夢に周と為れるか",
      "source": "庄子《齐物论》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "c01cde171c22ab4d17189d0d4b97714a0253beb36c60c363ac7d652803c83136"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P11_Zhuangzi_Butterfly",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "I cannot tell — / did Zhou dream he was a butterfly, / or does a butterfly dream it is Zhou?",
      "source": "庄子《齐物论》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "48107df45fd799c01ce9cb9521aceeb25131b47b390f26ca6e2f165577889017"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P11_Zhuangzi_Butterfly",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "I cannot tell — / did Zhou dream he was a butterfly, / or does a butterfly dream it is Zhou?",
      "source": "庄子《齐物论》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "48107df45fd799c01ce9cb9521aceeb25131b47b390f26ca6e2f165577889017"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P12a_LiBai_Wake",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "惟觉时之枕席 / 失向来之烟霞",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "a1778b663a2776dbe3cc03501b8a26464cea25edead726e115fde47e72b6dc41"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P12a_LiBai_Wake",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "惟覺時之枕席 / 失向來之煙霞",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "801f782a73699d09d9c40081e2ef12de2c90ead9d95ee856c9af4576e47178d9"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P12a_LiBai_Wake",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "惟だ覚めし時の / 枕席のみ / 向来の煙霞を失ふ",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "5690c5826876cdb6bb1013fb37451917a8d1e9a250c3080ceb5e77dba3bac4a9"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P12a_LiBai_Wake",
      "player_language": "en",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "Only the pillow and mat / of waking — / lost, the mists / and rosy clouds of before",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "08230756fd587a6c1f16d23a0547299c01af9c6c",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "ad2d338eeb2a46a457a6e5d31cb8c6109e25c5f865f118736afd89c4e725075e"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P12a_LiBai_Wake",
      "player_language": "de",
      "actual_language": "en",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "Only the pillow and mat / of waking — / lost, the mists / and rosy clouds of before",
      "source": "李白《梦游天姥吟留别》",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "08230756fd587a6c1f16d23a0547299c01af9c6c",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "ad2d338eeb2a46a457a6e5d31cb8c6109e25c5f865f118736afd89c4e725075e"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P12b_Keats",
      "player_language": "zh",
      "actual_language": "zh",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "那乐声已远去 / 我是醒着，还是睡着？",
      "source": "John Keats, Ode to a Nightingale (1819), last line",
      "original_language": "en",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "29fa6f2f1cc90d1573eddc4dead39d498dee5818",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": true,
      "text_sha256": "f61239200cca4d7df124e685181c8b3c92c6db00a5c42b56283789f3e9942526"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P12b_Keats",
      "player_language": "zht",
      "actual_language": "zht",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "那樂聲已遠去 / 我是醒著，還是睡著？",
      "source": "John Keats, Ode to a Nightingale (1819), last line",
      "original_language": "en",
      "first_exact_normalized_commit": "5277c7d6fbea1346adb22583a6d96897c7fcfd20",
      "first_commit_is_file_add": false,
      "text_sha256": "0677322f57db57e86d5b412ea02abc711be1eda08eef827ba6b38557bd25ddc2"
    },
    {
      "poem": "P12b_Keats",
      "player_language": "ja",
      "actual_language": "ja",
      "object": 0,
      "text": "あの調べは消えた / わたしは醒めているのか / 眠っているのか",
      "source": "John Keats, Ode to a Nightingale (1819), last line",
      "original_language": "en",
